央偏右，视觉重心稳定而富有张力。画面采用浅景深，背景虚化处理，使主体更加突出。视觉引导线由发丝、裙摆的飘逸弧度自然延伸，引导视线聚焦于少女的脸庞与服饰细节。光影柔和，主要光源来自左上方，形成温暖的逆光效果，勾勒出她轮廓的柔和光晕，同时在裙摆与发丝上形成细腻的高光与阴影过渡，增强立体感与真实感。\n\n整体氛围宁静、唯美、充满童话般的梦幻色彩，仿佛是被遗忘在森林深处的花神，或是一位从古堡中走出的洛丽塔公主。画面色调以粉白、浅绿、米白为主，辅以柔和的金色光晕，营造出温柔、纯净、略带忧伤的诗意美感。画面质感细腻，细节丰富，仿佛由高精度相机在自然光下拍摄，具有电影级的柔焦与层次感，适合用于艺术写真或插画风格的视觉创作。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 400, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 262, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [388], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [303.6851501464844, 330], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-713.2426147460938, 636.2999267578125], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "crop", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1920, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 543, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "proportional_width"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_height"}, "name": "proportional_height